1
00:00:03,207 --> 00:00:08,537
Open Content, Content Items, and create a new Handbook Page.

2
00:00:12,929 --> 00:00:17,882
Give the page a title, such as Supervisor handbook, and type its text.

3
00:00:17,882 --> 00:00:20,489
The role picker is below the text.

4
00:00:20,958 --> 00:00:24,887
The picker shows the hint, and lists the roles of the site.

5
00:00:24,887 --> 00:00:28,936
Search for a role, and tick the ones that may view this page.

6
00:00:28,936 --> 00:00:30,628
Here it is Supervisor.

7
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:32,696
Publish the page.

8
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:37,387
From now on, only people who hold the Supervisor role can view it.

9
00:00:38,821 --> 00:00:43,890
To lift the restriction from one page, untick all its roles and save.

10
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:49,431
To lift it from every page of the type, untick Restrict content on the part.

